  writing_visible: true\n    venue: ''\n    focus: 'MVP showed massive KL vs BCE gap (12.52 vs 44.05 PPL). Key uncertainty:\n      will BCE+compensation close this gap? If yes, headline shifts to \"KL eliminates\n      compensation overhead\" rather than \"KL is categorically better\". Also: seed\n      s456 is outlier (13.58 vs 12.08/11.91), variance needs attention.'\n    what_if: []\n    pid: 354802\n    chat_id: oc_dbbf8d2c695f1e79e11713aebc107790\n    card_message_id: om_x100b6f40a74d44a4c49f9c6d892beee\n    started_at: '2026-05-15T16:49:25+00:00'\n    updated_at: '2026-05-15T17:59:08+00:00'\n    stages_completed:\n    - imagine\n    - write\n    - review\n    error: null\n    context_hash: ec2055088a1f6e1a084a8ffba1dafd9a91e8e05f7c0b47ac018bcb0460ac10b0\n  dream_20260518T160251:\n    dream_id: dream_20260518T160251\n    project: distill_sparse_swiglu\n    status: imagining\n    review_mode: full\n    review_visible: true\n    writing_visible: true\n    venue: ''\n    focus: 测试论文 reframe 为 'mask pattern discovery' 叙事的接收度。核心变化：Contribution 1 从 gradient\n      coupling 转为 optimization target quality / mask pattern divergence。§3.6 gradient\n      analysis 降为 suggestive motivation。C1 ablation 变成 paper 核心实验。53% mask divergence\n      作为新发现。目标 4.0 Main Conference accept。\n    what_if:\n    - name: c1_ablation_bce_kl_targets\n      claim: 'Claim 1 reframe: optimization target quality > gradient coupling'\n      description: BCE trained on KL-derived oracle masks achieves comparable-or-better\n        PPL than KL distillation at matched sparsity. 53% mask divergence from magnitude\n        oracles. Core narrative shifts from 'gradient coupling explains KL advantage'\n        to 'KL discovers fundamentally different and superior mask patterns that magnitude-based\n        oracles miss'.\n      estimated_gpu_hours: 0.0\n    - name: dense_sparsity_sweep_6pt\n      claim: 'Claim 3: regime analysis with 6 data points'\n      description: KL predictors trained at 25%/30%/35%